    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In continuation of its commitment towards community development, Aga Khan University's (AKU) Department of Community Health Sciences (CHS) organised a Cleanliness Day in Sultanabad, a squatter settlement of Karachi, on Monday, March 6, 2006. The event was organised in order to mobilise the community to address the ongoing trash problems that face urban slum areas, and to sensitise the community stakeholders about the importance of garbage disposal, cleanliness and environmental hygiene.",
